  <item>
    <title>06.「精装」或「毛坯」，都是鲜活的你</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a32ba433ddcbb53c335e8f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a32ba433ddcbb53c335e8f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jul 2024 04:52:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好————久————不见啊朋友们！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>经历了无比忙碌的期末月，加之生活的一些变迁与动荡，我们终于在安顿好夏天之后，继续我们的「椰江 TALK」！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（一期原本有大纲、但是聊着聊着无时无刻不在脱轨的漫谈、💧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 前情提要——江的沪漂或许是一种</span><strong><span>显化。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> 江的生活充斥着</span><strong><span>毛坯的精装感</span></strong><span>——在某种意义上过上了向往已久的独居生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> 关于「滤镜」——美化、还原、沉淀or二次创作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">31:43</a> 滤镜是无处不在的——从阐释学角度而言，我们无所不在</span><strong><span>「前结构」</span></strong><span>中。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 关于「朋友圈」——名片、自我or人设？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 椰的</span><strong><span>「展示羞耻症」</span></strong><span>——克服尴尬还是悄悄幸福？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 精装朋友圈的背后是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">54:30</a> 「精装」意味着什么？「毛坯」意味着什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3950">1:05:50</a> 我们似乎更喜欢真实的「活人」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4403">1:13:23</a> 一些感悟和思考的分享</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>每个人对于「精装」都有不同的定义。你对「精装」定义是什么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>每个人都是「毛坯和精装」的混合体。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>抱持不论是「精装」或是「毛坯」所包含的</span><strong><span>生命力</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>✨希望我们都能接纳自己的生活，并且绽放出更加蓬勃的生命力吧！一起好好活儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《All My Life》-Wild</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgY3jdt33Psceq9jOxB1-jOvQHrQ.m4a" length="83751719" type="audio/mp4"/>
